  "bio": [
    "Peyush Bansal founded Lenskart Solutions a retailer of eyewear in 2010 together with his sister Neha and two others.",
    "Lenskart has a presence in 157 cities across India and 15 other countries.",
    "The company is backed by Japan's SoftBank Group and has a slew of marquee investors including Abu Dhabi Investment Authority, KKR and TPG.",
    "Lenskart was listed in November 2025 and raised $821 million in its IPO.",
    "Neha is an executive director on the board and the global head of merchandising,"
  ],
